      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Si addition and barrier formation will preserve the oxidation-resistant behavior of Cr.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to elemental Cr, the Cr–Si coating will show reduced Cr–Zr interdiffusion.",
